# 仓库内容一律使用 LF。工作区若被编辑器改写成 CRLF，git 比较时会先归一化，
# 不会再把整份文件显示成"已修改"（此前 87 个文件的行尾假差异即源于此）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做文本/行尾转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.msi binary
*.dmg binary
*.ipa binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.avi binary
*.webm binary
*.mkv binary
*.3gp binary
*.bcmap binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
